I just noticed that {jdika} [x1 (experiencer) decreases/contracts/is
reduced/diminished in property/quantity x2 by amount x3.] has no short
rafsi while {zenba} [x1 (experiencer) increases/is
incremented/augmented in property/quantity x2 by amount x3.] has both
{-zen-} and {-ze'a-}.

I thought that {-jia-} might be a good rafsi for {jdika}, is there any
way to suggest the addition of a short rafsi?

